<title>GEORGIA: Georgian Jan industrial output rises 17.9 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Georgian Jan industrial output rises 17.9 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TBILISI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georgian industrial output rose 17.9 percent in January 1997 from January 1996, the State Socioeconomic Information Department in the former Soviet republic said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    GEORGIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT     JAN 97  DEC 96  JAN 96</p>
<p>    year/year pct change	     +17.9   +22.8   +0.4</p>
<p>-- Tbilisi Newsroom  +995 32 983 961</p>
</text>
